message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "topon"
abstract: "topon generates polymer networks with a prescribed topology and writes them as LAMMPS input files. The network is built as a graph first, and the chemistry (coarse-grained or atomistic) is mapped onto it afterwards."
